{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Moses commanded us Torah.</b> They said to the blessed El: may Moses bear up to us Your words — which are the Torah He commanded us. And he says ״מִדַּבְּרוֹתֶיךָ״ (from Your speaking), as it says: וַיִּשְׁמַע אֶת הַקּוֹל מִדַּבֵּר אֵלָיו (Numbers 7:89)." "<b>An inheritance of the congregation of Jacob.</b> For it is an inheritance for the congregation of Jacob — handed down to us and to our children as an inheritance."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:29.141270915Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}